usage: contract mailbox send <to> --brief <text> [--steps N] [--for-id C]
       contract mailbox list [<to>]
       contract mailbox read <mail-id>
       contract mailbox step-complete <mail-id> --proof <evidence>
       contract mailbox step-next <mail-id>
MAUSAGE
        exit 2 ;;
