each aiko = Σ1 identity tied to a Solana Ed25519 keypair. Lineage walks via
parent_pubkey chain in aiko_spawned rows. fund emits TRANSFER REQUIRED block
(transport signs on-chain; substrate just records intent + lineage).
custody=privy|lobster are honest-gap (key generated locally, custody field
recorded; external custody integration deferred).

setup binds the substrate to a cwd's native surfaces (graff binary, AikoNotch
native app, spawn + chat endpoints). Idempotent — re-running reports the
existing aiko_cwd_bound row when surfaces are unchanged. Honest gaps are
surfaced as evidence; KEY 2 judges whether to spawn child contracts to close
them.
