  decompose)
    # contract decompose "<prompt>" — Lambda1-driven decomposition of a
    # multi-claim prompt into a proposed organ structure (root + children +
    # dependency edges). Complements the existing `plan` verb: `plan` is
    # Step-0 discovery (related-contracts + skill matches via BM25/embed);
    # `decompose` is the spawn-children layer (LLM reads the prompt, names
