Agent confirms; declared root + spawn/fan-out commands are surfaced.

Pair with `contract plan` (discovery-first) to do the full genesis arc:
  contract plan "<prompt>"        # step 0: discover related contracts + skills
  contract decompose "<prompt>"   # spawn-children: parallel/serial layout
  # then run the suggested commands to declare + dispatch

Example:
  contract decompose "ship the dashboard, update the docs, push to gitea after both"
USAGE
