  layer)
    # Ω5 layer-identify: classify a request at L0..L4 (Psychology doctrine,
    # 5 abstraction layers) so the agent knows which layer to resolve FIRST.
    # Heuristic — substrate surfaces, agent judges. Human-replicating order:
    # L4 (intent) → L3 (truth-claim) → L2 (next-action) → L1 (substrate) → L0 (mechanical).
